~ start
Detective: Good morning, I’ve called you all here to discuss Ettore’s murder.
Detective: I wanted to let you know that, after two days of investigation, we've solved the case.

do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: Damn, bro. I didn’t hit him in the head.
Detective: Don’t worry, Mr. Bravo, because this is where things get funny, the autopsy revealed that the cause of death was poisoning.
Jonny Bravo: Poisoning? How is that possible?
Detective: That’s a great question, Mr. Bravo. Does anyone else want to say anything?
do watch_to_npc("Wednesday")
Wednesday: Um…
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Shut up, don’t say a word.
Detective: Giordano, do you want to say something, or should I speak? Let me remind you that if I have to speak, there will be no sentence reductions.
do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: Giordano, it's over, it's all gone to hell.
do watch_to_npc("Mohamed_Alibaba")
Mohamed Alibaba: Karen’s right.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: What the hell is going on? Why are you guys talking like that?
do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: You told us it would go smoothly, you bastard.
do watch_to_npc("Mohamed_Alibaba")
Mohamed Alibaba: I knew that laundromat was a shitty place.
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Shut up, all of you, can’t you see you’re digging your own graves?
do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: It’s too late now.

do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Too late my ass, they don’t have any evidence.
Detective: Wednesday, do you have anything to say?
do watch_to_npc("Wednesday")
Wednesday: Yeah
Wednesday: It was all of us.
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Holy shit. You fucking bitch.

do watch_to_npc("Wednesday")
Wednesday: Giordano orchestrated the whole thing. He came to my house and told me the truth about my brother's death.
Wednesday: That bastard Ettore dragged my brother Saturday into a drug ring during one of their business meetings.
Wednesday: Shortly after that, my brother became addicted to drugs, to the point that one day we found him having an overdose.
Wednesday: So Giordano proposed a plan to kill Ettore, got me the poison, and I took care of the rest in the laundry room.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: Oh Mama.

do watch_to_npc("Mohamed_Alibaba")
Detective: Wednesday, thank you for your honesty; it will be taken into account in court. Is there anyone else who wants to speak?
Mohamed Alibaba: I'll speak now.
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Ugh...
do watch_to_npc("Mohamed_Alibaba")
Mohamed Alibaba: Giordano came to see me too, he knew what Ettore had done to me. 
Mohamed Alibaba: Ettore was my boss when I was an intern. He exploited me and constantly belittled me just because I was an immigrant.
Mohamed Alibaba: At one point, I stood up to him and filed a complaint against him for workplace bullying.
Mohamed Alibaba: Not only did he fire me, but he also made sure I wouldn’t be hired anywhere else, effectively ending my career.

Detective: Great. Do you want to take it from here, Karen?

do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: Yes, Detective, I had a wonderful life, a great husband, and two kids.
Karen: All that changed when Ettore came along and took my husband away from me.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: But how many people did this Ettore kill?
do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: No, Jonny, he didn’t kill him, he slept with him and took him away from me by marrying him.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: Oh Mama.
do watch_to_npc("Karen")
Karen: And you can imagine the rest: Giordano contacted me and told me there was a way to make Ettore pay.

do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Detective: Giordano, what do you want to do now?
Giordano: That bastard deserved it. I'm ashamed to be his son.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: OH MAMA.
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: Yes, he's my father. He abandoned me and my mom because he was gay.
Giordano: From that moment on, my mother and I were on our own.
Giordano: My mother tried to get child support by suing Ettore.
Detective: Ah... yes, of course, the Montgomery case.
Giordano: That's right, but he won hands down because he had excellent lawyers; that man had connections everywhere.
Giordano: I was only 4 years old at the time, and shortly after that, my mother took her own life. And I ended up in an orphanage.
Giordano: I even paid his intern to get his shirt dirty at 2 a.m., so he'd have no choice but to come to my laundry, the only one open at that hour.

Giordano: The plan was simple: get Ettore there, poison him, and then get rid of his body.
Giordano: But things started to go wrong when Wednesday came out.
Giordano: The moment Jonny walked in, everything started to fall apart.
Giordano: The poison would have started to take effect shortly after that, so we had to improvise.
Detective: Yeah, sure, so you decided to get rid of Jonny, too.
Detective: To do that, Mohamed cut the power when he moved.
Detective: Meanwhile, Karen tried to take Jonny out, but ended up hitting Ettore instead.
Giordano: Yeah, and when I came out, Jonny was already calling an ambulance.
do watch_to_npc("Jonny_Bravo")
Jonny Bravo: Damn, bro, so you wanted to kill me too?
do watch_to_npc("Giordano")
Giordano: No, you idiot, we wanted to knock you out while we took care of Ettore.

Detective: I can only imagine what Ettore put you through, but a crime is always a crime, and now you'll have to pay.
Detective: The case is closed.
=> END